				Time="2011-05-24T08:16:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はーい！
[Name:TrainerName ]！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:19:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T08:16:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・pos起動
　GRIDX=100～104、GRIDZ=301
・画面左上方向から博士（娘）登場
・博士（娘）、GRIDX=86、GRIDZ=294に到達すると
　！マークを表示後、主人公に隣接して
　メッセージ表示
・続けてhakase2_02
・0＝主人公名前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:17:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ博士娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T08:16:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
