	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c06_hakase2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やっと　ライブキャスターを　つかわず
おはなしが　できたわね！▼
あらためまして
わたしが　アララギ　です！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:20:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T04:08:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>やっと　ライブキャスターを　使わず
お話が　できたわね！▼
あらためまして
わたしが　アララギ　です！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:20:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T04:08:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・続けてhakase2_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:28:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ博士娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T03:58:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c06_hakase2_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしの　おねがいを　きいて
ポケモンずかんを　うけとり▼
パートナーとした　ポケモンと
ここまで　きてくれたんだよね……▼
じゃあ　さっそく　だけど
ひょうか　させて　もらうわね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:23:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:31:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたしの　お願いを　きいて
ポケモン図鑑を　受け取り▼
パートナーとした　ポケモンと
ここまで　来てくれたんだよね……▼
じゃあ　さっそく　だけど
評価させて　もらうわね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:23:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:31:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・続けてhakase2_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:28:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ博士娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:31:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c06_hakase2_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName ]が　いままでに
みた　ポケモンは　[Digit:3digits Idx="1" ]ひき……▼
なるほどね！　ありがとう！
これは　かんしゃの　きもちよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:19:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:31:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName ]が　いままでに
みた　ポケモンは　[Digit:3digits Idx="1" ]匹……▼
なるほどね！　ありがとう！
これは　感謝の　気持ちよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:19:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:31:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手処理
　No381「わざマシン５４」（みねうち）
・0＝主人公名
・1＝みつけた匹数</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:19:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ博士娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:31:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
