	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c06_swleader6_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フウロ『あら！　じゃないですよ▼
ひこうきに　のるから　じゅんびは
たのんだわよ！　って　きたのは▽
アララギはかせ　ですよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:00:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:36:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フウロ『あら！　じゃないですよ▼
飛行機に　乗るから　準備は
頼んだわよ！　って　きたのは▽
アララギ博士　ですよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:28:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:12:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・続けてhakase2_10</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:32:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER6
ジムリーダー・フウロ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:56:44" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c06_hakase2_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アララギ『あはは！　そうだったわね
だけど　そのまえに　おねがい！▼
タワーオブヘブンを　しらべたいの！
だから　それまで　まってて！▼
それじゃあね　[Name:TrainerName ]！
どんなときでも　ポケモンと　なかよくよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:32:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:36:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アララギ『あはは！　そうだったわね
だけど　その前に　お願い！▼
タワーオブヘブンを　調べたいの！
だから　それまで　待ってて！▼
それじゃあね　[Name:TrainerName ]！
どんなときでも　ポケモンと　仲良くよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T13:06:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:12:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・メッセージ表示後、ｒ07方面へ移動
・画面外に消えると続けてswleader6_03
・0＝主人公名前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T12:34:01" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ博士娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T11:36:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
